  "sourceTitle": "Gazpacho Relish",
  "sourceText": "Gazpacho Relish\nBy: Melissa Peterman\nPublished: Friday, December 10, 2010 - 1:02am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 tablespoons small diced red pepper\n2 tablespoons  cucumber\n2 tablespoons red onion \n2 tablespoons red tomatoes\n1 teaspoon Minced garlic\n1 tablespoon Lime juice\n1 tablespoon Olive oil\nSalt and pepper\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine ingredients in a non-reactive bowl and chill for 1 hour. Taste for seasoning and adjust.\n\nAbout\n\n\nUse as a condiment. Optional canning: triple the recipe and pour ingredients into small sterile jars and preserve by using a hot-bath method.",
